  "description": "Several days of torture is not enough to make the Captain disclose the location of his team’s safe house. Seeing that their tricks are working in vain, his captors call in the Colonel to get the vital information out of him. This cold-blooded Colonel will readily kill anyone within a heartbeat to get the information he needs. However, the Captain just so happens to have a pretty face…and the Colonel knows just what he wants to do to it. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
